## 项目架构

```
app/
├── page.tsx              ← Client Entry (ThemeProvider + I18nProvider + NewYorkerSpline)
├── layout.tsx            ← Root Layout (zh-CN, Geist font, Analytics)
├── globals.css           ← Tailwind 4 + YYC³ 主题变量
└── api/chat/route.ts     ← Ollama SSE API (zod验证 + rate limiting)

components/
├── new-yorker-spline.tsx ← 28行组装入口
├── lib/                  ← constants.ts + effects.tsx
├── layout/               ← navbar.tsx (Navbar/ThemeToggle/LanguageSwitcher/ScrollProgress)
├── sections/             ← hero/philosophy/scenario/architecture/ai-family/footer
├── chat-widget.tsx       ← Ollama 聊天组件
└── ui/                   ← 60+ shadcn/ui 组件

locales/                  ← 10语言 × 79键 (zh-CN 权威源)
hooks/                    ← use-mobile.ts + use-toast.ts
lib/                      ← i18n-client.ts + utils.ts
```

